he said, would you like
to have Ben Stiller

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:12.510
or Brad Pitt play you?

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:15.003
And of course I said, Brad Pitt, you know.

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:19.238
Everybody who's a male wishes
they looked like Brad Pitt,

00:22:19.238 --> 00:22:21.300
which I certainly don't.

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:23.370
Well, Dr. Fauci, we watched it

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:24.990
so you didn't have to, you know?

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:28.020
You were too busy trying to
get that information across.

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:29.820
Thank you very much for
sparing the time today.

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:30.928
It's been good to talk to you.

00:22:30.928 --> 00:22:32.363
My pleasure, good to be with you.

00:22:32.363 --> 00:22:33.279
Thank you for having me.
Thank you.

00:22:33.279 --> 00:22:35.730
And thank you for being with us, too.

